WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.597 --> 00:00:06.801
Conflict is a serious disagreement - about what someone wants, thinks or expects.

2
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.949
Your line never changes.

3
00:00:09.188 --> 00:00:11.574
Observe - watch and listen.

4
00:00:11.813 --> 00:00:13.722
Calm it with words.

5
00:00:13.961 --> 00:00:16.347
Report it to your supervisor.

6
00:00:16.586 --> 00:00:24.222
And if it isn't working, or isn't safe, escalate - step back and pass it up.

7
00:00:24.461 --> 00:00:26.370
You never touch anyone.

8
00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:32.336
And if someone abuses or threatens you, report it - every time.
